## 📞 Common First Questions

**Q: App won't run?**
A: 
```bash
flutter clean
flutter pub get
flutter run
```

**Q: Can't see SVG characters?**
A: Make sure characters_svg.dart is copied and flutter_svg is installed:
```bash
flutter pub add flutter_svg
```

**Q: Where do I add audio files?**
A: Create `assets/audio/` and add `aleph.m4a`, `bet.m4a`, etc.

**Q: How do I test on my phone?**
A: Connect via USB and run `flutter run`

